cameraHeading=Text("Camera","h2")
cameraText=Text("For rear cameras, the Galaxy S25 is the most versatile because it adds a telephoto lens, which helps with optical zoom.\n\nThe Pixel 9 and iPhone 16 both have strong dual-camera setups, but the Pixel 9 has the larger ultra-wide sensor on paper, while the iPhone 16 uses a 48 MP main camera paired with a 12 MP ultra-wide camera.")
